# Normalise line endings on checkin and check out LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows with the default `core.autocrlf=true` gets
# CRLF working-tree files. The codegen drift check compares generated output
# byte-for-byte against the committed files, so CRLF makes every generated file
# look modified and the check fails on a clean tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
